{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1439.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"7c8c008a94ea0c02ca7e4249a7529de449b24f6bfeedf46f34729a18da46455b","ja":"ライバルはいつも近くに","zh":"对手总在身边","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1439.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"07465fe5e4cd5cdb95b7e334050da68dd5d14bc25194be75bf3178d4406cb3bc","ja":"千鶴と昴は、ドラマのオーディションに来ていて……","zh":"千鹤和昴来到了电视剧的试镜现场，然后……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1439.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"445b36f3f5d4ebeec9d7c8a47112f2b8fa5a67a18b86d93f8c4fa1ca9c728107","ja":"昴、そろそろわたくし達の番ですわよ。\n準備はよろしくて？","zh":"昴，差不多该轮到我们了哦。\n准备好了吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1439.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"78a04e364f771e789532b70e29601ac5aa73acf8de20fd1ad99a4f693a5ee0a7","ja":"…………えっ？\nあっ、もうそんな時間か！","zh":"…………咦？\n啊，已经这个时间了吗！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1439.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"b136c6d8bac302ea3f23f1319ecc89fceea8ff87142ab6ad26e04c2eae9c8de1","ja":"ずいぶん熱中して読んでましたのね。\nそれは……あら、マンガですの？","zh":"看得很入迷呢。\n那是……哎呀，是漫画吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1439.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"ecbfaa6fc1ec4fcfd1f82fc3964d9d9dc976002f968b762cfe29b298bad63965","ja":"うん！　野球マンガを、まつりに借りたんだ。\n主人公が甲子園を目指す話なんだけど……。","zh":"嗯！我向茉莉借了棒球漫画。\n讲的是主角以甲子园为目标的故事……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1439.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"b4d15013d8d8a84870c83b6dbbec462cee449e278052de34a9535f7ad543b68c","ja":"何度もぶつかり合ってきたライバルと、\n最終決戦の真っ最中でさ。","zh":"正和屡次交锋的宿敌，\n展开最后的决战呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1439.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"845606369dbc79dbbd8d834990904ebb96f6f4f33a330aaeebe0ed344db58b7f","ja":"「こいつには負けない！」って、限界以上の力を\n出して戦ってる姿が、すっげー燃えるんだよな～！","zh":"那种抱着“绝不能输给这家伙！”的念头、超常\n发挥全力奋战的身姿，真是让人热血沸腾啊～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1439.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"76d61bdf7737f261e047040d50ef93fd0e00688ad34bd64e10703403e914679c","ja":"ふふっ、そうですの。面白そうですわね。","zh":"呵呵，是吗。听起来很有趣呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1439.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"32ccf4e71d20a7d3ff9893818fe0b2322e0184508b8b901d25faea0254934a6f","ja":"ああ！　こんなライバル関係って、\n憧れるよな～。オレにもこんな相手がいれば……。","zh":"啊！这种竞争对手般的关系，\n真让人憧憬啊～。要是我也有这种对手的话……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1439.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"4a7dee6c8103f6f3c1ec5a1a6a849c135e7cdcfa5629c4c569127f00bd3909a8","ja":"あら、それなら、ここに\nたくさんいらっしゃるではありませんか。","zh":"哎呀，要是那样的话，这里\n不就有好多位吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1439.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"24f5b59862d9a6a202275cdbd56a70accbba77bbbc73117c80576020c1c410e7","ja":"……えっ！？　どういうことだ？","zh":"……诶！？怎么回事？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1439.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"d6df98cda2b3fa7772c604ee7c2c907ba5f322f9991e723db294829e95d2a352","ja":"わたくしたちは、トップアイドルという目標を掲げて、\n切磋琢磨しあっているライバル……。","zh":"我们以成为顶尖偶像为目标，\n是互相切磋琢磨的竞争对手……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1439.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"003d17170c0d9b9e8d5c3638468284c8d9201f941a0a6fde699e3cfbf0cda06e","ja":"誰もが「他のアイドルには負けない！」という思いで、\nこのオーディションに挑んでいるのですわよ！","zh":"每个人都是怀着“绝不输给其他偶像！”的信念，\n来挑战这次试镜的哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1439.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"73df151ab5351550f2eb881f07de1a73877da180bb651e09535fd4fb8aa6342d","ja":"そっか……！　オレにとっては\nここにいる全員がライバルなんだな！","zh":"原来是这样……！对我来说，\n这里的全员都是竞争对手啊！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1439.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"ab4f4866e86339dcae0b75ae55b9c89d38f8263a47b77161e3d3b85ac4d6390f","ja":"もちろん、わたくしもそのひとりですわ！\nオーディション、全力で戦いましょう！","zh":"我也自然位列其中！\n试镜，就让我们全力以赴地去战斗吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1439.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"b3aceb8861ad5f3809cd9de19f973c8470a1d08f75593b9ab4a6ec1d08057fc7","ja":"へへっ！　なんかテンション上がってきたぜ！\nよ～しっ！　絶対、役を取ってやるぞー！","zh":"嘿嘿！总觉得情绪高涨起来了！\n好～嘞！我一定要把角色拿下来——！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
